OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer used AI to create
OL,4,Astatement - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Court of Appeal has rejected a
OL,7,Fsentence appeal by a man who threatened
OL,8,Fhis partner with a knife, after it
OL,9,Femerged a police officer had used AI to
OL,10,Fdraft a witness statement.
OL,12,FThe court heard the officer, who has
OL,13,Fbeen removed from front-line duties,
OL,14,Fused Microsoft Copilot to create a
OL,15,Fstatement to "make a judge or reader
OL,16,Fweep" and help secure the highest
OL,17,Fsentence.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
