OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer used AI to create
OL,4,Astatement - court
OL,5,
OL,6,FJerome Gibson, 23, was jailed for 44
OL,7,Fmonths last year after kicking down a
OL,8,Fdoor, threatening his partner with a
OL,9,Fknife, and later causing grievous
OL,10,Fbodily harm to a police officer.
OL,12,FHis lawyer argued the statement led the
OL,13,Fsentencing judge to place greater
OL,14,Fweight on the harm caused, but judges
OL,15,Frejected Gibson's appeal on Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
